<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Asignar Correlativas</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 p-4">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-700">Paso 2: Asignar Correlativas</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm">Seleccioná las materias que son requisito para cursar o rendir esta nueva materia. (La materia actual ya fue ocultada de la lista).</p>

        <form action="/plan-subject/correlatives" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
            
            <input type="hidden" name="program_id" value="{{program_id}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="plan_subject_id" value="{{plan_subject_id}}">

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Requisitos de Cursada:</label>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-y-auto border border-gray-300 p-3 rounded bg-gray-50 shadow-inner">
                        {{#subjects}}
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-200 p-1 rounded">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="curseReqs" value="{{id}}" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600">
                                <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">{{name}}</span>
                            </label>
                        {{/subjects}}
                        {{^subjects}}
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">No hay otras materias cargadas.</p>
                        {{/subjects}}
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Requisitos de Examen:</label>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-y-auto border border-gray-300 p-3 rounded bg-gray-50 shadow-inner">
                        {{#subjects}}
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-200 p-1 rounded">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="examReqs" value="{{id}}" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600">
                                <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">{{name}}</span>
                            </label>
                        {{/subjects}}
                        {{^subjects}}
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">No hay otras materias cargadas.</p>
                        {{/subjects}}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t">
                <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-green-600 text-white py-3 rounded font-bold text-lg hover:bg-green-700 transition">
                    Guardar Materia y Continuar
                </button>

                <div class="text-center">
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">¿Te equivocaste en los datos de la materia? Volvé al paso anterior:</p>
                    <a href="/plan-subject/create?program_id={{program_id}}" 
                       class="inline-block mt-1 text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 text-xs font-semibold underline">
                       ← Volver a cargar los datos de la materia
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t flex justify-center">
                <a href="/program-of-study/cancel?id={{program_id}}" 
                   onclick="return confirm('¿Seguro que querés cancelar? Se borrará el plan incompleto y perderás todo el progreso.');"
                   class="text-red-500 hover:text-red-700 hover:underline text-xs font-semibold transition duration-150">
                   Cancelar carga y descartar todo el plan
                </a>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>